@MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get transactions with OData filtering
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/Transactions?$filter=Amount gt 100&$orderby=Date desc&$top=25&$count=true
Accept: application/json

### Get OData metadata
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/$metadata
Accept: application/xml

###
